00 nits brightness, it delivers crystal-clear visuals with vibrant colors and no shadows. Built-in 40W audio complements video conferencing needs, creating a complete, plug-and-play meeting room solution perfect for boardrooms, training rooms, and executive spaces.\", \"sku\": \"BL-RDY-MTG136\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/meeting-room-led-136\", \"category\": \"ready-made\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_meeting-room-led-136.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 2000, \"highPrice\": 15000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/meeting-room-led-136\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"1.5mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"600 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What makes the Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\" a better choice over traditional projectors?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This LED display offers a bright 600-nit panel with 4K UHD resolution, providing vibrant, clear visuals without shadows or glare, unlike projectors. Its seamless, large 136\\\" screen combined with built-in audio ensures a complete, high-quality meeting room experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\" is designed as a plug-and-play solution with a drop-in replacement setup. It requires standard electrical power and minimal mounting space, simplifying installation compared to complex projector systems.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support options are provided with this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"We offer a comprehensive warranty covering parts and labor for up to 3 years. Our technical support team is available for installation guidance, maintenance, and troubleshooting to ensure uninterrupted performance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this LED display support video conferencing systems?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the display integrates built-in 40W audio and is compatible with most conferencing devices, providing clear visuals and audio for meetings without requiring additional sound systems.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the 1.5mm pixel pitch affect image quality?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 1.5mm pixel pitch ensures extremely fine pixel density, delivering razor-sharp images and text that are easily viewable even at close range, which is ideal for detailed presentations and video content.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is this product energy-efficient compared to other display solutions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, LED technology is inherently more energy-efficient than traditional projectors, consuming less power while providing superior brightness and image quality, reducing operational costs.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the expected pricing framework for this all-in-one unit?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Pricing varies based on installation complexity and optional add-ons, but as a premium ready-made solution, it provides competitive value compared to assembling separate components like projector, screen, and audio.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\" be customized for different room sizes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This model is optimized for 136-inch meeting rooms as a turnkey solution. For other sizes or configurations, custom options are available but would require consultation.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\"\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/meeting-room-led-136\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136&quot;</h1><p>Enhance meetings with our 136&quot; All-in-One LED display in Dubai. Buy now for superior visuals in UAE corporate spaces.</p><p><strong>Drop-in replacement for projectors. 136&quot; 4K LED. Plug and play.</strong></p><p>The Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136&quot; is a premium 4K UHD seamless LED display designed as a direct drop-in replacement for traditional projectors. Featuring a 1.5mm pixel pitch and 600 nits brightness, it delivers crystal-clear visuals with vibrant colors and no shadows. Built-in 40W audio complements video conferencing needs, creating a complete, plug-and-play meeting room solution perfect for boardrooms, training rooms, and executive spaces.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes the Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136&quot; a better choice over traditional projectors?</h3><p>This LED display offers a bright 600-nit panel with 4K UHD resolution, providing vibrant, clear visuals without shadows or glare, unlike projectors. Its seamless, large 136&quot; screen combined with built-in audio ensures a complete, high-quality meeting room experience.</p><h3>What are the installation requirements for this LED display?</h3><p>The Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136&quot; is designed as a plug-and-play solution with a drop-in replacement setup. It requires standard electrical power and minimal mounting space, simplifying installation compared to complex projector systems.</p><h3>What warranty and support options are provided with this product?</h3><p>We offer a comprehensive warranty covering parts and labor for up to 3 years. Our technical support team is available for installation guidance, maintenance, and troubleshooting to ensure uninterrupted performance.</p><h3>Can this LED display support video conferencing systems?</h3><p>Yes, the display integrates built-in 40W audio and is compatible with most conferencing devices, providing clear visuals and audio for meetings without requiring additional sound systems.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n9:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"products\\\",\\\"meeting-room-led-136\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":