s brightness, it delivers crystal-clear visuals with vibrant colors and no shadows. Built-in 40W audio complements video conferencing needs, creating a complete, plug-and-play meeting room solution perfect for boardrooms, training rooms, and executive spaces.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat makes the Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\u0026quot; a better choice over traditional projectors?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis LED display offers a bright 600-nit panel with 4K UHD resolution, providing vibrant, clear visuals without shadows or glare, unlike projectors. Its seamless, large 136\\u0026quot; screen combined with built-in audio ensures a complete, high-quality meeting room experience.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat are the installation requirements for this LED display?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\u0026quot; is designed as a plug-and-play solution with a drop-in replacement setup. It requires standard electrical power and minimal mounting space, simplifying installation compared to complex projector systems.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat warranty and support options are provided with this product?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe offer a comprehensive warranty covering parts and labor for up to 3 years. Our technical support team is available for installation guidance, maintenance, and troubleshooting to ensure uninterrupted performance.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eCan this LED display support video conferencing systems?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes, the display integrates built-in 40W audio and is compatible with most conferencing devices, providing clear visuals and audio for meetings without requiring additional sound systems.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"