text\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\"\", \"description\": \"The Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\" is a premium 4K UHD seamless LED display designed as a direct drop-in replacement for traditional projectors. Featuring a 1.5mm pixel pitch and 600 nits brightness, it delivers crystal-clear visuals with vibrant colors and no shadows. Built-in 40W audio complements video conferencing needs, creating a complete, plug-and-play meeting room solution perfect for boardrooms, training rooms, and executive spaces.\", \"sku\": \"BL-RDY-MTG136\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/meeting-room-led-136\", \"category\": \"ready-made\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_meeting-room-led-136.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 2000, \"highPrice\": 15000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/meeting-room-led-136\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"1.5mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"600 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Tba7,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What makes the Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\" a better choice over traditional projectors?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This LED display offers a bright 600-nit panel with 4K UHD resolution, providing vibrant, clear visuals without shadows or glare, unlike projectors. Its seamless, large 136\\\" screen combined with built-in audio ensures a complete, high-quality meeting room experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\" is designed as a plug-and-play solution with a drop-in replacement setup. It requires standard electrical power and minimal mounting space, simplifying installation compared to complex projector systems.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support options are provided with this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"We offer a comprehensive warranty covering parts and labor for up to 3 years. Our technical support team is available for installation guidance, maintenance, and troubleshooting to ensure uninterrupted performance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this LED display support video conferencing systems?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the display integrates built-in 40W audio and is compatible with most conferencing devices, providing clear visuals and audio for meetings without requiring additional sound systems.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the 1.5mm pixel pitch affect image quality?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 1.5mm pixel pitch ensures extremely fine pixel density, delivering razor-sharp images and text that are easily viewable even at close range, which is ideal for detailed presentations and video content.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is this product energy-efficient compared to other display solutions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, LED technology is inherently more energy-efficient than traditional projectors, consuming less power while providing superior brightness and image quality, reducing operational costs.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the expected pricing framework for this all-in-one unit?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Pricing varies based on installation complexity and optional add-ons, but as a premium ready-made solution, it provides competitive value compared to assembling separate components like projector, screen, and audio.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\" be customized for different room sizes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This model is optimized for 136-inch meeting rooms as a turnkey solution. For other sizes or configurations, custom options are available but would require consultation.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\\\\\"\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/meeting-room-led-136\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"t