"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T7ce,<h1>Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136&quot;</h1><p>Enhance meetings with our 136&quot; All-in-One LED display in Dubai. Buy now for superior visuals in UAE corporate spaces.</p><p><strong>Drop-in replacement for projectors. 136&quot; 4K LED. Plug and play.</strong></p><p>The Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136&quot; is a premium 4K UHD seamless LED display designed as a direct drop-in replacement for traditional projectors. Featuring a 1.5mm pixel pitch and 600 nits brightness, it delivers crystal-clear visuals with vibrant colors and no shadows. Built-in 40W audio complements video conferencing needs, creating a complete, plug-and-play meeting room solution perfect for boardrooms, training rooms, and executive spaces.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes the Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136&quot; a better choice over traditional projectors?</h3><p>This LED display offers a bright 600-nit panel with 4K UHD resolution, providing vibrant, clear visuals without shadows or glare, unlike projectors. Its seamless, large 136&quot; screen combined with built-in audio ensures a complete, high-quality meeting room experience.</p><h3>What are the installation requirements for this LED display?</h3><p>The Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136&quot; is designed as a plug-and-play solution with a drop-in replacement setup. It requires standard electrical power and minimal mounting space, simplifying installation compared to complex projector systems.</p><h3>What warranty and support options are provided with this product?</h3><p>We offer a comprehensive warranty covering parts and labor for up to 3 years. Our technical support team is available for installation guidance, maintenance, and troubleshooting to ensure uninterrupted performance.</p><h3>Can this LED display support 